        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\triangle ADE\\sim\\triangle ACB$ by AAA.",
          "worked": "The angle at A is common. The matching single arcs give $\\angle ADE=\\angle ACB$ and the matching double arcs give $\\angle AED=\\angle ABC$. Hence $\\triangle ADE\\sim\\triangle ACB$ by AAA.",
